OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FPatchy cloud
OL,6,Fgiving a few early evening showers
OL,7,Facross southeast England. Clear
OL,8,Fperiods elsewhere. However, some
OL,9,Fcloud, and breezy in the north and
OL,10,Fnorthwest, with some showers. Fresher
OL,11,Ffor most, but remaining rather warm
OL,12,Fand muggy in the southeast overnight.
OL,13,
OL,14,CFriday:FMostly dry in the south and
OL,15,Fsoutheast on Friday with some warm
OL,16,Fspells of sunshine. Cooler, with a
OL,17,Fbreeze towards the north and
OL,18,Fnorthwest, and a scattering of showers.
